{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-04-27 11:00:00', 'title': 'FIS INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , APRIL 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. ("FIDELITY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: FIS). CLASS PERIOD: FEBRUARY 9, 2021 – FEBRUARY 10, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: MAY 5, 2023 IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF OF THE FIDELITY LAWSUIT, YOU CAN SUBMIT YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AT WWW.GLANCYLAW.COM/CASES/FIDELITY-NATIONAL-INFORMATION-SERVICES-INC/.'}{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-04-27 05:45:00', 'title': 'FIS LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. ("FIDELITY NATIONAL" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: FIS) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF FIDELITY NATIONAL INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}